{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/29839","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:35.806761+00:00","comments":[],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"### Description\n\ncc @yashk2810 \n\nThe following code works without sharding, but fails under sharding with the following error\n```python\nValueError: PartitionSpec passed to broadcast_in_dim cannot contain axis names that are of type Auto or Manual. Got PartitionSpec: PartitionSpec('S', None, None, None) with axis name: S of type: AxisType.Auto, This error occurs at source:  <ipython-input-4-586e473b618d>:24:11 (_set_at)\n```\n\nHowever I can't understand the what's wrong with my code.\nAs it works fine without sharding, I suspect that it might be some wrong annotations. \n\nMWE\n```python\nimport jax\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\nfrom jax.sharding import PartitionSpec as P, AxisType, reshard\nfrom jax.experimental.shard_map import shard_map\nfrom functools import partial\n\nif jax.sharding.get_abstract_mesh().empty:\n    jax.config.update(\"jax_num_cpu_devices\", 4)\n    mesh = jax.make_mesh((4,), ('S'), axis_types=(AxisType.Explicit,))\n    jax.sharding.set_mesh(mesh)\n\nB, D = 20, 6\nacting_on = jnp.array([[3]], dtype=jnp.int64)  # shape [1, 1], broadcasted\nx = jnp.ones((B, D), dtype=jnp.int8)\nxs = reshard(x, P('S', None))\n\n@partial(jax.vmap, in_axes=(0, None))  # over B\n@partial(jax.vmap, in_axes=(None, 0))  # over 1\ndef _set_at(x, acting_on):\n    return x.at[acting_on].set(1.0)\n\ndef fun(x, acting_on):\n    if x.ndim == 1:\n        x = x.reshape(1, x.shape[-1])\n\n    sharding = jax.typeof(x).sharding\n    xp_offdiag = jax.sharding.auto_axes(_set_at, out_sharding=sharding)(x, acting_on)\n    return xp_offdiag\n\n# (sharding) works\nxp_offdiag = fun(xs, acting_on)\n# (no sharding) works\njax.vmap(fun, in_axes=(0,None))(x, acting_on)\n# (sharding) fails\njax.vmap(fun, in_axes=(0,None))(xs, acting_on)\n```\n\n\n### System info (python version, jaxlib version, accelerator, etc.)\n\n```\njax:    0.7.0.dev20250629+bdaee5132\njaxlib: 0.6.2\nnumpy:  2.2.6\npython: 3.13.3 (main, May 22 2025, 01:38:47) [Clang 20.1.4 ]\ndevice info: cpu-4, 4 local devices\"\nprocess_count: 1\nplatform: uname_result(system='Darwin', node='mbp-10841385', release='24.5.0', version='Darwin Kernel Version 24.5.0: Tue Apr 22 19:54:49 PDT 2025; root:xnu-11417.121.6~2/RELEASE_ARM64_T6000', machine='arm64')\n``","closed_at":"2025-07-01T18:58:30Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/44061?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/copybara-service","id":56741989,"login":"copybara-service[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NTY3NDE5ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments":0,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/29839/comments","created_at":"2025-06-29T21:19:28Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/29839/events","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/29839","id":3186581339,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"tota